@crew v-ferro-rhea
// Writer 4, batch 5: a short-stay visitor. Mostly not about work.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Evening. Rhea Ferro, charts office. That sofa's mine for the week.
- Hello. I'm meant to be mapping your corridors. I'm mapping your lounge.   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance
- {hi}, {me}. I know where everything is now. I'm a little sad about it.   #funny
?

== chat
- The charts office thinks I'm working. I am. On this sofa. Thoroughly.   #funny
- Every ship's lounge has a best seat. Yours is by the curve of the window.

== near
? place:lounge
- The office. Pull up a chair. Not that one, it squeaks.   #funny
? deck:2
- The stars here aren't on any chart yet. I like that more than I should.
?

== bye
- {bye}. If anyone asks, I was working.   #funny

== smalltalk
- This is the office.   #funny
- Not bad, this ship.
